<%= header_section(@subject) %>
<div>
  <% if @subscription.is_installment_plan %>
    <p>We were not able to process the latest payment for your installment plan for <%= @subscription.link.name %>. The address on it is in a location that United States sanctions prevent us from processing payments to or from, so no charge was attempted and there is nothing wrong with your card.</p>
    <p>If that address is out of date, <%= link_to "update it from your installment plan", @edit_card_url %> and the next payment will go through normally.</p>
    <p>Otherwise your installment plan for <%= @subscription.link.name %> will be paused in 5 days and you will lose access to the product. You can read more about <%= link_to "why a payment can be declined", "https://gumroad.com/help/article/203-why-did-my-payment-fail#Not-available-in-your-location-Xr4mB" %>.</p>
  <% else %>
    <p>We were not able to process the latest payment for your membership to <%= @subscription.link.name %>. The address on it is in a location that United States sanctions prevent us from processing payments to or from, so no charge was attempted and there is nothing wrong with your card.</p>
    <p>If that address is out of date, <%= link_to "update it from your membership", @edit_card_url %> and the next payment will go through normally.</p>
    <p>Otherwise your membership to <%= @subscription.link.name %> will be canceled in 5 days. You can read more about <%= link_to "why a payment can be declined", "https://gumroad.com/help/article/203-why-did-my-payment-fail#Not-available-in-your-location-Xr4mB" %>.</p>
  <% end %>
</div>
